# Feature Architecture & File Layout

## Strategic Purpose
Enterprise recruiting / analytics / NCAA compliance platform for 2026: $20.5M revenue-share cap, 105-man rosters, NIL collectives. Unifies verified telemetry, AI film, sports IQ, and FinTech escrow in a multi-tenant command center.

## Phases 1–4 Modules
| Domain | Modules |
|---|---|
| Front Office | `CapGMRosterSimulator`, Transfer Portal, Leaderboard/Directory |
| Scouting | `BioScanTelemetryModule`, `TrueSpeedModule`, Cognition, Combine Laser (P4), Autonomous Scouting (P4) |
| Coaching Ops | `AiFilmTaggingStudio`, Coach Pipeline Board |
| Compliance/FinTech | `RallySafeEscrowModule`, `MultiTenantRoleSelector`, Parent Consent (P4) |

## Canonical Paths
- Types: `src/types.ts` (`CapGMRoster`, `BioScanTelemetry`, `MultiTenantUser`, etc.)
- SPA root / RBAC state: `src/App.tsx`
- Cap math tests: `src/capGmTestSuite.ts`
- Mock data: `src/data/mockData.ts`
- Master shell: `src/components/GridironGatewayDashboard.tsx`
- Backend: `server.ts` (REST RallySafe/Laser + WS BioScan)

Prefer extending existing named components over inventing parallel files.
